1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,416
Six weeks later, just when everyone
thought the matter had been resolved...

2
00:00:09,750 --> 00:00:14,250
Hey, you won’t believe this,
but Lina filed a labour claim!

3
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:20,792
The HR manager says that we’ll be arguing
that she abandoned her job and that her employment had already ended.

4
00:00:20,792 --> 00:00:24,500
We have evidence: attendance records
showing she stopped coming to work;

5
00:00:25,060 --> 00:00:27,750
the company policy on unauthorised
absence;

6
00:00:27,849 --> 00:00:33,000
the clause in Lina’s contract; and payroll
records showing when her salary stopped.

7
00:00:33,750 --> 00:00:38,000
What do you think happened? What do you
think was the outcome of this case?

